'''''Lyracystis radiata''''' is an [[extinct]] [[genus]] of [[Cambrian]] [[eocrinoidea|eocrinoid]] [[echinoderm]], [[fossils]] of which are known from the [[Burgess Shale]] of [[British Columbia]], [[Canada]]. It is related to ''[[Gogia]]''.

